{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":14.72},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":16.32,"end":34.96},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":36.72,"end":50.24}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.64,"text":"較重的目標會改變動量分配。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3.36,"end":5.36,"text":"提高發射速度的代價很大，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":5.64,"end":8.4,"text":"因為動能隨速度平方成長。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.96,"end":10.24,"text":"設計關卡時，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.32,"end":12.4,"text":"應先比較質量選項，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.48,"end":14.72,"text":"再決定是否提高速度。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":16.32,"end":21.76,"text":"固定發射物質量 1、速度 4、恢復係數 1，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":22.4,"end":24.96,"text":"比較目標質量 1 和 3。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":25.68,"end":28.64,"text":"觀察發射物反彈與目標速度。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":30.4,"end":32.48,"text":"質量不變、速度加倍時，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":32.8,"end":34.96,"text":"初始動能如何改變？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":36.72,"end":38.88,"text":"質量不變、速度加倍時，"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.28,"end":41.6,"text":"初始動能如何改變？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":43.04,"end":46.96,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":47.6,"end":50.24,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}